1位となった。","category":"culture","region":"japan","importance":99.6,"sources":[{"label":"Wikipedia: 吾峠呼世晴","url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%90%BE%E5%B3%A0%E5%91%BC%E4%B8%96%E6%99%B4"},{"label":"Wikipedia: 2020年","url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/2020%E5%B9%B4"}]}]}